Marks this tree as the "admin" dream silo.

Sessions working on Porter's admin surface are tagged `admin` so the nightly
dream reads them as their own corpus, separate from general software work.

⚠️ This file is the ONLY thing that made the admin silo detectable, and it did
not exist until 2026-08-02. The silo ran 36 times over an empty corpus and
produced zero proposals every time — reporting green while learning nothing.
A silo whose marker is missing is not idle, it is broken, and it looks identical
to one with nothing to say.

Detection walks parent directories (silo-detector.ts), so anything under
admin/ counts, not just this exact directory.
